                                            <th style="padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;">ط§ظ„ط¨ظ†ظƒ ط§ظ„ط¬ط¯ظٹط¯</th>
                                            <th style="padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;">طھط§ط±ظٹط® ط§ظ„ظ…ط±طھط¯</th>
                                            <th style="padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;">طھط§ط±ظٹط® ط§ظ„طھط¹ط¯ظٹظ„</th>
